  "description": "Wake up to breathtaking countryside views, breathe fresh mountain air, and enjoy complete peace and privacy in the heart of the Alentejo. Surrounded by unspoilt nature, rolling hills, hiking trails, and historic windmills, this charming country home offers an authentic Portuguese lifestyle while being just 50 minutes from the Algarve&#39;s beautiful beaches.Located in the picturesque village of Moimentos, this spacious 5-bedroom home is ideal as a permanent residence, holiday retreat, or investment property, offering exceptional value and endless potential.The property features five generously sized bedrooms, a cosy living room with a traditional fireplace, one bathroom, and a private outdoor area where you can relax and enjoy the spectacular natural surroundings throughout the year.Major renovation work has already been completed, including a new roof, updated plumbing, polished floors, and fresh interior and exterior paint. The main remaining project is the installation of a kitchen, giving the new owner the opportunity to design and personalise it to their own taste.Also included in the sale is a separate ruin located just across the street, offering exciting potential for a garage, workshop, storage space, or another project, subject to the necessary permissions.Despite its peaceful rural setting, the property offers excellent access to the Algarve, combining the tranquillity of countryside living with the convenience of nearby beaches, restaurants, and everyday amenities.Whether you&#39;re looking for a spacious family home, a peaceful escape, or an investment in one of Portugal&#39;s most authentic and unspoilt regions, this property is a rare opportunity not to be missed.Please feel free to reach out. Private owner",
